      <https://w3id.org/iadopt/ont/Variable>;
    dct:description "The experimentally determined rate at which a chemical degrades in a laboratory surface-water system that simulates environmentally realistic aerobic conditions, typically expressed as a first-order rate constant (k) or half-life (DT₅₀).";
